Package: DFDNxbq
Title: Deep Fall Detect Net by xbq
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "DFDNxbq", family = "Team",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "dfdnxbq@example.com")
Description:
    Implements the DFDNxbq fall detection pipeline with
    ConvLSTM/CNN/GRU-TCN-SE deep encoders, HIBA hierarchical
    attention mechanism, and ensemble classifiers (Random Forest,
    SVM, CatBoost) under LOSO (Leave-One-Subject-Out)
    cross-validation. Supports Butterworth, Kalman, Wavelet, and
    Savitzky-Golay signal denoising methods.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0)
Imports:
    randomForest,
    e1071,
    pROC,
    signal,
    dlm,
    wavelets,
    reticulate
Suggests:
